"2. The NVIDIA Container Toolkit on your host.\n"
"3. A 'deploy' block with 'capabilities: [gpu]' in docker-compose.yml.\n"
"\n"
"Auto detects all three and falls back to CPU instead of failing."
msgstr ""
"Для принудительного GPU нужны все три, иначе транскрипция не сработает:\n"
